WEBVTT

00:10.880 --> 00:17.360
You come with me you two hand over your weapons follow my soldiers.

00:19.120 --> 00:22.280
Of course, of course we will follow the general's orders.

00:23.880 --> 00:25.280
Mount up.

00:33.720 --> 00:39.400
Your Highness General Shilang already knows that this time the Xuan army went north was.

00:39.480 --> 00:45.640
Promoted entirely by Prince of Jin for Prince of Jin to have such courage he deeply admires.

00:45.720 --> 00:51.627
Saying Your Highness in the future will surely be Xuan Kingdom's new ruler General Shilang wishes to befriend Your Highness.

00:51.960 --> 00:56.280
Both sides cease fighting and each gets what they need, how about it?

00:57.160 --> 01:00.120
Then tell me what does Shilang need?

01:00.200 --> 01:01.640
And what do I need?

01:01.720 --> 01:07.600
General Shilang is willing to give Yiyang City to Your Highness but.

01:07.680 --> 01:13.360
When Your Highness ascends the throne please appoint General Shilang as Prince Zhenbei.

01:13.480 --> 01:17.880
And grant the prosperous land of Qing Province as his domain what a deal.

01:18.400 --> 01:21.640
To trade our Xuan city for our Xuan province.

01:22.440 --> 01:28.040
General, please don't be angry let me finish speaking that year General Shilang.

01:28.120 --> 01:33.720
Was the first to enter Yong'an by chance he obtained a great treasure.

01:38.040 --> 01:43.387
This treasure green as blue in color smooth and square with a jade chi-tiger knob.

01:43.480 --> 01:48.400
Is precisely our Xuan Kingdom's imperial seal what?

01:48.480 --> 01:53.040
How could that be? What a reversal of truth invading our country.

01:53.120 --> 01:57.960
Is said to be entering Yong'an massacring the entire court stealing the seal.

01:58.640 --> 02:01.400
Is said to be by chance obtaining a great treasure.

02:02.520 --> 02:08.000
You, a Xuan person acting as a dog under the enemy dare to speak nonsense.

02:08.680 --> 02:14.960
Believe it or not I'll kill you right now Your Highness this official wouldn't dare this official absolutely wouldn't dare.

02:15.040 --> 02:19.880
To risk my own head as a joke if Your Highness is interested.

02:19.960 --> 02:24.760
You can wait until tonight the seal will be sent into the city.

